# Route: guide 23 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 43 to 44, 29
# quests, 1.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Duskwood, Stranglethorn Vale): Darkshire -> Tranquil Gardens Cemetery
# -> Darkshire -> Brightwood Grove -> The Yorgen Farmstead -> Vul'Gol Ogre
# Mound -> Darkshire -> Tranquil Gardens Cemetery -> Darkshire -> Raven Hill
# Cemetery -> Addle's Stead -> Darkshire -> Raven Hill Cemetery -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Mor'Ladim (228; Mor'Ladim 35); The
# Star, the Hand and the Heart (735; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the
# Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Crime and Punishment (377), Crime and Punishment (377).

